ction fire +5%, ice -5%)</span>.<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by knights of level 100 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 120.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It gives 5% protection against <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">fire</a>, but also increases damage taken from <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">ice</a> attacks by 5%. This armor also raises your Sword Fighting skill by 2.\n</p><p>Obtainable in the <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Spawn%20of%20Morgathla\">Ancient Spawn of Morgathla</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lord%20of%20the%20Elements\">Lord of the Elements</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morgaroth\">Morgaroth</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Spawn%20